# Vendored C facade header for the R package (issue #17). Only resolve_capi.h
# lives here now and it is a tracked, load-bearing source file (the package's
# only engine header); track it but ignore any other copied headers.
r/src/resolve/*
!r/src/resolve/resolve_capi.h
benchmarks/results_*.json

# Load-bearing tracked files inside otherwise-ignored locations.
# do_build.bat: build script referenced from progress.md (MSVC fix history).
# launch_build.ps1: documented build entry point in port.md and global CLAUDE.md.
# fuzzy_index_plan.md: plan implemented by FuzzyIndex C++ + bindings_fuzzy.cpp.
!src/core/build_cuda/do_build.bat
!src/core/build_cuda/launch_build.ps1
!dev_notes/fuzzy_index_plan.md
